SUMMARY:Jizo Peace Project Oct — Sebastopol Center For the Arts\, Califo
 rnia
DTSTART:20261002T000000
DTEND:20261003T000000
UID:ecece47e465597525151262cd2d06c86@sebarts.org
DESCRIPTION:Jizo Peace Project: Clay Gathering for Remembrance and Peace\,
  October\n\n  \n    \n      \n        \n          $10.00\n        \n      
 \n    \n  \n\nFriday\, October 2\, 2026\; 1:30 – 4:00pmDue to limited ca
 pacity\, we are asking for a suggested donation of $10 to the Sebastopol C
 enter for the Arts to confirm your attendance. Bring a copy of your receip
 t at check-in to Painting/Drawing Studio adjacent to Ceramics Studio. Addi
 tional donations are welcome at the time of the class to cover rental and 
 expenses for the peace project. Join us for a monthly\, heart-centered gat
 hering where we come together to create Jizo guardians out of clay—symbo
 ls of compassion\, protection\, and peace. Rooted in the Buddhist traditio
 n and echoed across many cultures\, Jizo figures traditionally honor child
 ren and all who have passed\, those in transition\, and those in distress.
 This ongoing project is dedicated to remembering those lost to war\, with 
 a special focus now on the approximately 19\,000 children who have perishe
 d in Israel and Gaza in recent years. Through the simple\, meditative act 
 of working with clay\, we create benevolent beings that will become part o
 f public exhibits and peace sites\, offering spaces for reflection\, mourn
 ing\, and hope. Our gatherings conclude with a gentle ritual to honor the 
 lives of these children.Located in the Painting & Drawing Room. The gather
 ing is open to ages 12 - adult\, and no prior clay experience is necessary
 —all clay and basic materials are supplied. Registration is required to 
 participate.Donations are welcome to help cover materials and expenses. Mo
 re than a class\, this is a shared space of warmth and care—an opportuni
 ty to tend to our own hearts while taking part in love in action.\n\n\n\n\
 n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n          \n     
